# Frontend configuration. Copy to `.env.local` for local development.

# Where Next.js forwards /api/* requests. Must point at the FastAPI app.
# Server-side only, so the backend origin never reaches the browser bundle.
BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# The browser always calls relative /api on this origin. Do not add a second
# API base URL: the session cookie is host-only and is forwarded by the rewrite.

# Set to `mock` to run the whole app on in-memory fixtures with no backend.
# Leave it unset for real work, including production. The public guest demo
# is the explicit /manager?tour=1 and ?demo=1 routes, not this flag.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_SOURCE=mock
#
# On Vercel, BACKEND_ORIGIN must be the https URL of the deployed API.
# The value is read when the app is built.
